+  # `core` job; the optional JIT backend behind `wasmtime-engine` needs
+  # Cranelift, which does not build on the 2 GB development machine (measured:
+  # rustc killed by the OOM killer). A bigger runner does build it, so the
+  # second backend is compiled, tested and NC'd here. Until this job is green,
+  # `wasmtime` is pinned but unproven — say so, never the opposite.
